    {
      "claim": "All other L1 gold-context records report F values at or above 20% (cilomilast 96%, vernakalant 58–71%, irbesartan about 60–82%, imipramine 43.6%, ranolazine 35–50%, urapidil 72%, anlotinib 41–77%, ONO-4641 0.710), so the calibrated gold context does not support a low prediction.",
